OL,3,GNEWSAGuests still waiting for
OL,4,Abelongings after hotel fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuests evacuated from a hotel in
OL,7,FFolkestone during a fire more than 10
OL,8,Fdays ago have said they are still
OL,9,Fwaiting to reclaim belongings and
OL,10,Fvehicles left behind.
OL,12,FAbout 280 guests were forced to leave
OL,13,Fthe Grand Burstin Hotel in Marine
OL,14,FParade due to the blaze on 19
OL,15,FSeptember, while about 90 residents
OL,16,Fwere also evacuated from homes nearby.
OL,18,FAn investigation by Kent Police into
OL,19,Fthe cause of the blaze, which is being
OL,20,Ftreated as suspicious, is continuing.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
