OL,3,GNEWSAGuests still waiting for
OL,4,Abelongings after hotel fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FHotel bosses have not responded to the
OL,7,FBBC over the guests' concerns, but
OL,8,Fpreviously said the site remained
OL,9,Finaccessible because it was an active
OL,10,Fcrime scene.
